+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="UTF-8">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+<title>Frontier · IlluminationHost — drift yard · smoke &amp; fire · fracture · distance-field GI</title>
+<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
+<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
